        "TileImage": "$($repository 28595162-719b-4659-b42d-e90d1a387c65).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47,\r\rAfter the incidents of the Isle of Sgail, ive seen a lot of activity going on in Colombia. A Colombian team is tracking us down and we need to dismantle them from top to bottom. Up first is the &quot;Vanisher&quot; the one who makes fake passports to get to us in the first place. Then Hector Delgado with the cash for the operation. While we are there you should take down\rDioscoro, he gets the &quot;supplies&quot;. We also neet to take down Catalina to upset the organization. Exit via helicopter.",
